Package: h5linker
Type: Package
Title: Minimal Test Package Linking to hdf5lib
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel P.", "Smith", email = "dansmith01@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Daniel P. Smith <dansmith01@gmail.com>
Description: A simple package that includes minimal C code calling an HDF5 function.
    Its purpose is to test if linking against the 'hdf5lib' package works correctly
    during R CMD check or install.
